# DRAW keymap preset: Krita  (SAFEST — only DRAW-free target keys remapped)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt.  Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# Policy (Rick, "safest"): applied ONLY if the target key is UNBOUND in DRAW. Collisions
# are documented, not applied — decide them in PLANS/PRESETS-KEYMAP-DECISIONS.md.
#
# Already matching Krita: B brush, E eraser toggle-ish, T transform/text, M mirror-ish,
# Ctrl+Z/Y, Ctrl+A/D. Krita leans on modifiers + a HUD, so few plain-letter clashes.

# --- Safe remaps (target key free in DRAW: Ctrl+I/J/K/U/W) ---
# Ctrl+J  Duplicate Layer  ->  DRAW "Duplicate Layer" (707). Ctrl+J is unbound in DRAW.
707 106 1 0

# --- COLLISIONS (need a decision; NOT applied) -------------------------------
#   F   Fill (bucket)       -> DRAW F is Fill tool ALREADY (match — no row needed)
#   G   Gradient / edit     -> DRAW G is a grid chord initiator
#   R   Reference / colour  -> DRAW R is Rectangle tool
#   C   (contextual)        -> DRAW C is Ellipse tool
#   P   Colour picker mode  -> DRAW P is Polygon tool (I is Picker in DRAW)
#   S   (freehand select)   -> DRAW S is Smart Shapes
#   Ctrl+Shift+N New Layer  -> DRAW already Ctrl+Shift+N (match)
